1. Quotation (QT): Create and submit SO using the parent selling bundle only. 
2. Sales Order (SO): Create from QT, using the parent selling bundle only. 
3. Delivery Note (DN): Create DN from SO, 
  1. Add non-selling bundles
  2. Submit. 
  3. Mark DN as delivered 
4. Return Note (RN): Create RN from DN, 
  1. Explode only the bundles that contain used items 
  2. Update unused quantities
  3. Submit. 
5. Sales Invoice (SI): Create and submit SI from SO, parent selling bundle only. 